# Tayam, Luminous Enigma. "Each other creature you control enters with an additional vigilance counter on it" (CR 614.1c):
# Bot1's Ornithopter and Walking Ballista (X=1) get one each, the Ballista beside its +1/+1 counter; Tayam itself gets none,
# and Bot2's Llanowar Elves, an opponent's creature, none. "{3}, Remove three counters from among creatures you control"
# (CR 118.3, any kinds, the ruling): the Ornithopter's vigilance counter and both of the Ballista's pay it, and the Ballista,
# a 0/0 without its +1/+1 counter, dies. "Mill three cards, then return a permanent card with mana value 3 or less from your
# graveyard to the battlefield": not targeted, so a card just milled may be chosen (the ruling). Argothian Elder (mana value
# 4) and Lightning Bolt (not a permanent) can't be; Elvish Spirit Guide (exactly 3) is, and enters under Tayam with a
# vigilance counter of its own.

